choice("Continue", B2-Ch02a-Recreation, v_current_scene = B2-Ch02a-Recreation)


ID: B2-Ch02a-Recreation
TEXT:

#if(v_b2_ch2_fist != 3 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 4 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 5) {
I slide off the stone slab, stow the sweater in my pack, and head out into the common yard. After locking the heavy oak door behind me, I find an empty stretch of wall well away from the others.

A quick sweep of the yard shows the full division muster. Aside from Bruce and Wilhelm, there is the silver-haired girl with her unblinking stare, and two rough-hewn cutthroats who look like gladiator copies of Cutthroat Dave. The two thugs mutter quietly in the center of the room. The other three stay isolated along the perimeter, backs against the masonry, arms crossed, waiting out the mandatory two hours.

With no word on the opening trial's format, planning tactics is pointless. I lean against the stone, debating whether to head back inside for my notebook, when Bruce pushes off his pillar and lumbers directly toward me. His weathered face is set in a grim line.

"Listen," he rumbles. "I saw you talking with Wilhelm last night. I wanted to give you a warning."

"A warning?" I ask.

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 3 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 4 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 5) {
I slide off the stone slab, stow the sweater in my pack, and head out into the common yard. After locking the heavy oak door behind me, I find an empty stretch of wall well away from the others.

A quick sweep of the yard shows the full division muster. Aside from Bruce and Wilhelm, there is the silver-haired girl with her unblinking stare, and two rough-hewn cutthroats who look like gladiator copies of Cutthroat Dave. The two thugs mutter quietly in the center of the room. The other three stay isolated along the perimeter, backs against the masonry, arms crossed, waiting out the mandatory two hours.

With no word on the opening trial's format, planning tactics is pointless. I lean against the stone, debating whether to head back inside for my notebook, when Wilhelm pushes off his wall and strides smoothly toward me, a resolute gleam in his eye.

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 0 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 0) {
"About Wilhelm," Bruce says, lowering his voice. "He plays the friendly comrade, but he moves like a guild assassin. Footwork, balance, the way his eyes track vitals. You can't trust that breed. They aren't real fighters like you and me. All they know is driving steel into a man's back. Watch yourself around him. Don't swallow a word he feeds you."

"Good to know," I say. "I'll keep an eye on him. Thanks."

"Just stay alive until the gate lifts," Bruce says, clapping a heavy hand on my shoulder. "You're the only other man in this miserable block who can throw a proper punch."

He returns to his post by the pillar. Before I can turn back toward my cell, Wilhelm glides across the flags, falling in beside me with a polite, measured expression.

"Look," Wilhelm says, "I don't know what Bruce was whispering, but you should tread carefully with that one."

"Should I?"

"He acts on impulse," Wilhelm says smoothly. "Men like that are dangerous. Friendly today, swinging tomorrow. When someone relies entirely on brute force over reason, you never know when the turn is coming."

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 1 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 1) {
"About Wilhelm," Bruce says, lowering his voice. "He plays the friendly comrade, but he moves like a guild assassin. Footwork, balance, the way his eyes track vitals. You can't trust that breed. They aren't real fighters like you and me. All they know is driving steel into a man's back. Watch yourself around him. Don't swallow a word he feeds you."

"I clocked him as an assassin last night," I say. "Don't worry, I have him marked."

"Just stay alive until the gate lifts," Bruce says, clapping a heavy hand on my shoulder. "You're the only other man in this miserable block who can throw a proper punch."

He returns to his post by the pillar. Before I can turn back toward my cell, Wilhelm glides across the flags, falling in beside me with a polite, measured expression.

"Look," Wilhelm says, "I don't know what Bruce was whispering, but you should tread carefully with that one."

"Should I?"

"He acts on impulse," Wilhelm says smoothly. "Men like that are dangerous. Friendly today, swinging tomorrow. When someone relies entirely on brute force over reason, you never know when the turn is coming."

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 3 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 4 && v_b2_ch2_fist != 5) {
"About Wilhelm," Bruce says, lowering his voice. "He plays the friendly comrade, but he moves like a guild assassin. Footwork, balance, the way his eyes track vitals. You can't trust that breed. They aren't real fighters like you and me. All they know is driving steel into a man's back. Watch yourself around him. Don't swallow a word he feeds you."

"I clocked him as an assassin last night," I say. "Don't worry, I have him marked."

"Just stay alive until the gate lifts," Bruce says, clapping a heavy hand on my shoulder. "You're the only other man in this miserable block who can throw a proper punch."

He returns to his post by the pillar. Before I can head for my door, Wilhelm approaches, forcing an easy posture.

"Good morning," Wilhelm says. "I hope I am not intruding. I wanted to revisit our conversation from last night. If I gave you any reason to doubt my intentions, I assure you I will do everything in my power to—"

"Listen, Wilhelm," I cut in. "After our little chat, I assumed you were smart enough to keep your distance until the matches concluded. Clearly I gave you too much credit. Let me make my stance unmistakable."

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 3 && v_b2_ch2_threatened != 2 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 4 && v_b2_ch2_threatened != 2 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 5 && v_b2_ch2_threatened != 2) {
"Good morning," Wilhelm says. "I picked up word you might find useful. In a few hours, the ambassador and the arena master are meeting to finalize the trials. The guards in this wing have a habit of gossiping about administrative orders. Keep an ear to your door when patrols pass. I intend to do the same."

"Useful tip," I say. "I'll listen in."

"Good," Wilhelm says. "If I hear specifics, I will pass them along. I trust you will do the same."

"Of course."

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 3 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 4 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 5 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2) {
"Good morning," Wilhelm says. "I hope I am not intruding. I wanted to revisit our conversation from last night. If I gave you any reason to doubt my intentions, I assure you I will do everything in my power to—"

"Listen, Wilhelm," I cut in. "After our little chat, I assumed you were smart enough to keep your distance until the matches concluded. Clearly I gave you too much credit. Let me make my stance unmistakable."

"What do you mean?" he asks, tension tightening his shoulders.

"I am offering you a simple choice," I say. "I don't know who bought your contract or what grudge you carry. But you are an assassin, not a frontline duelist. You survive on ambush and blind spots. You can still try for my spine, but the problem is that I am already waiting for the strike. If you think the bounty is worth that gamble, step up. If not, stay across the yard."

"Understood," Wilhelm says, the color draining from his face. "I will not trouble you."

He turns and retreats to his corner.

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 0 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 1 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 0 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 1) {
"Fascinating," I tell him. "Though I doubt that is why you crossed the floor."

"True," Wilhelm concedes. "I picked up word you might find useful. In a few hours, the ambassador and the arena master are meeting to finalize the trials. The guards in this wing have a habit of gossiping about administrative orders. Keep an ear to your door when patrols pass. I intend to do the same."

"Useful tip," I say. "I'll listen in."

"Good," Wilhelm says. "If I hear specifics, I will pass them along. I trust you will do the same."

"Of course."

}
#if(v_b2_ch2_fist == 1 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2 || v_b2_ch2_fist == 2 && v_b2_ch2_threatened == 2) {
